      "name": "[Blueprint] Legendary Gear: Stun - Lv. 60",
      "desc": "Use this Blueprint at the Smart Workshop to unlock the recipe for this item. Obtained through investigations or purchased from Boojee's Store - Permanent Store - Blueprint Direct Sale.\n\nItem Effect: Increases Impact by <color=#2BAD00>20%</color>. When an Agent Stuns an enemy, all squad members recover <color=#2BAD00>30</color> Energy, <color=#2BAD00>30</color> Adrenaline, or <color=#2BAD00>30</color> Sharpness. This effect can trigger once every <color=#2BAD00>20</color>s. When an Agent hits a Stunned enemy, the target's Stun DMG Multiplier increases by <color=#2BAD00>30%</color>.",
